<title>FRANCE: ATHLETICS-FACT FILE ON STACY DRAGILA.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-FACT FILE ON STACY DRAGILA.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fact file on Stacy Dragila, who equalled the women's world indoor pole vault record of 4.40 metres on Sunday.</p>
<p>Born March 25, 1971, in Reno, Nevada. Graduate of Idaho State University.</p>
<p>A former hurdler who turned initially to the heptathlon in which she has personal best of 5,291 points.</p>
<p>She has broken the U.S. indoor pole vault record three times.</p>
</text>
